{"id":"1a859725f17832d5","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable.md","title":"Upper Semicomputability of C and K","display":"thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable — Upper Semicomputability of C and K","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable","aliases":["43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable"],"display":"thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable — Upper Semicomputability of C and K","depends_on":["[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-pair-coding]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§6.5, computable decreasing approximation K_s","source_printed_pages":"99","source_pdf_pages":"119","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable — Upper Semicomputability of C and K"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.5, computable decreasing approximation K_s"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"99"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"119"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>；自然数参数按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 编码。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a> 的部分可计算性；下式给出的函数类型同时要求在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\">\\(\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\)</span> 上总定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists a,b:\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(a)\\land\\mathrm{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(a(\\sigma,s+1)\\le a(\\sigma,s)\\land b(\\sigma,s+1)\\le b(\\sigma,s))\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(C(\\sigma)=\\lim_{s\\to\\infty}a(\\sigma,s)\\land K(\\sigma)=\\lim_{s\\to\\infty}b(\\sigma,s))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists a,b:\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(a)\\land\\mathrm{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(a(\\sigma,s+1)\\le a(\\sigma,s)\\land b(\\sigma,s+1)\\le b(\\sigma,s))\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(C(\\sigma)=\\lim_{s\\to\\infty}a(\\sigma,s)\\land K(\\sigma)=\\lim_{s\\to\\infty}b(\\sigma,s))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从已知统一可计算上界开始，逐阶段搜索更短的已停止描述；对普通机器作同样处理。不能把“从上可近似”升级为可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.5, computable decreasing approximation K_s；印刷页 99，PDF 页 119。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pair-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-kolm]] 的 $C$ 和 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-kolm]] 的 $C$ 和 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-kolm]] 的 $C$ 和 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]] 的部分可计算性；下式给出的函数类型同时要求在 $\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N$ 上总定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists a,b:\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(a)\\land\\mathrm{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(a(\\sigma,s+1)\\le a(\\sigma,s)\\land b(\\sigma,s+1)\\le b(\\sigma,s))\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(C(\\sigma)=\\lim_{s\\to\\infty}a(\\sigma,s)\\land K(\\sigma)=\\lim_{s\\to\\infty}b(\\sigma,s))\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1877,"backlinks":[{"id":"f0c7d6fbe9cca58a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]；这种有限值上逼近的存在性见 [[43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-complexity-upper-semicomputable]] — Upper Semicomputability of C and K"}],"outgoing":["a0589ee7a1cc12e8","6cd902d852c2c848","f357216a7edb035a","e039afac1517f3d7"]}